  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在这个生存世界中，你将探索高耸的山峰、深邃的峡谷与绵延的江河。毫无疑问，其体验远超普通原版 Minecraft 生存。你可以将其用于服务器。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082089/description_4dfdda8a-0672-4efd-87fd-16df6c1625cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 这张地图提供了原版所缺乏的内容：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 平滑的地形</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 农田</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 自定义森林</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 山地景观渐变</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 以及<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">更多</span>内容！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 这些项目的实现得益于像你这样慷慨的捐赠者。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 祝你游玩愉快 :)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">也来看看我的其他地图吧！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七个生存岛屿</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘之岛</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">J.M.J.</span></strong></p>",
